OL,3,GNEWSAKing to lead two-minute silence at
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King is due to lead the nation in a
OL,7,Ftwo-minute silence at the Cenotaph in
OL,8,FWhitehall, central London, to mark
OL,9,FRemembrance Sunday - you'll be able to
OL,10,Fwatch live coverage above
OL,12,FHe will lay a wreath at the memorial as
OL,13,Fpart of the service to remember those
OL,14,Fwho died in conflict
OL,16,FSome 10,000 armed forces veterans will
OL,17,Ftake part in the Royal British Legion's
OL,18,Fmarch-past through Whitehall, alongside
OL,19,Fabout 20 World War Two veterans
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
