OL,3,GNEWSAKing to lead two-minute silence at
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlongside the King, Andy Burnham will
OL,7,Fappear at the service - he'll be joined
OL,8,Fby former PMs including Boris Johnson,
OL,9,FTony Blair and John Major
OL,11,FAway from the capital, services will
OL,12,Falso take place in communities across
OL,13,Fthe UK, including in Edinburgh, Belfast
OL,14,Fand Cardiff
